"""
app/workflows/codegen/router.py
--------------------------------
FastAPI sub-router for the Milestone 5 Code Generation workflow.

Mounted at:  /projects/{project_id}/codegen
by app/workflows/router.py via include_router().

Endpoints
---------
POST   /runs                             trigger_codegen
GET    /runs                             list_codegen_runs
GET    /runs/{run_id}                    get_codegen_run
POST   /runs/{run_id}/approve            approve_codegen
GET    /runs/{run_id}/bundle/download    download_bundle

Background task pattern
-----------------------
trigger_codegen() returns 202 immediately and fires the orchestrator graph
via FastAPI BackgroundTasks.  Callers poll GET /runs/{run_id} for status.

The background task wrapper catches all exceptions, marks the run failed
in the DB, and logs — it never lets an unhandled exception propagate out
of the background task (which would silently swallow it in FastAPI).

Authentication
--------------
All endpoints use get_current_user from app.auth.dependencies.
Project-level access is verified via verify_project_access() which
confirms the authenticated user has read/write access to project_id.
"""

